Package: BiocAgentRAGDB
Title: RAG Knowledge Base for BiocAgent from Bioconductor Package Sources
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jacques Serizay", ,
        email = "jacquesserizay@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides a pre-built retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)
    database derived from the source code, vignettes, and metadata of all
    Bioconductor packages. The database is hosted on ExperimentHub and
    cached locally via BiocFileCache. It is designed to be used by the
    'BiocAgent' package to ground LLM responses in real Bioconductor
    documentation. Includes utilities to fetch, update, and manage the local
    copy of the RAG database.
License: Artistic-2.0
